	(text "PWMk (1 = switch on) -> RS-422 pair, terminated on the power board. 10k pull-downs: ePWM balls are\ninputs without pull-up during reset/boot (table 6-6), so every gate command is 0 until firmware runs.\nG = C4_DRV_EN, G~ high: outputs high impedance unless CHB_OK, C4_EN_MCU and RDY are high (INT-15).\nePWM13-16 have no high-resolution PWM: buck-boost cells only, not a DAB bridge."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 262.176 105.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "eea05c6b-ce4a-5137-8c37-b8052aa2fc38")
	)
