	(text "TPS26600, MODE open: circuit breaker I(CB) 1.30-1.61 A (RILIM 8.06k 1 %, eq. 4 + table 7.5), 4 ms, 540 ms\nauto-retry; factory UVLO 15 V / OVP 32.6 V (UVLO, OVP to RTN); SHDN open = on (self-biased 2.7 V).\ndVdT 680n (CSR-03): 0.13-0.23 V/ms, 26.4 V in 115-208 ms; 600 uF draws <= 0.137 A, so start-up <= 1.14 A per\nport and 4.55 A for four (SYS +24V_GD limit >= 4.69 A). Start-up dissipation <= 6.7 W (resistive-load\nmodel, eq. 22-24) vs SLVSDG2G figure 55 at 85 C (graph reading, not verified). Asserted on every build.\nA shorted cell cable trips only its own eFuse. A PTC was rejected: MF-MSMF110 holds only 0.73 A at 60 C."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 119.368 80.98 0)
		(effects
